ar?action=getcompany&CIK=0001099800&type=8-K&owner=exclude&count=40","proxyFilingsUrl":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0001099800&type=DEF%2014A&owner=exclude&count=40","officialMaterialsUrl":"https://ir.edwards.com/","transcriptPolicy":"Use an issuer-published transcript when available. Otherwise use the official webcast, prepared remarks, earnings release, and 8-K exhibits; third-party transcripts are secondary and may contain errors."},"sources":[{"title":"EW SEC filing library","meta":"SEC EDGAR · Issuer record","href":"https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0001099800&owner=exclude","excerpt":"The issuer record provides EDWARDS LIFESCIENCES CORP''s filing history, including annual, quarterly, current, proxy, ownership, and registration disclosures."},{"title":"EW annual reports","meta":"SEC Forms 10-K · Primary filings","href":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0001099800&type=10-K&owner=exclude&count=40","excerpt":"Annual reports provide the audited financial statements, business and segment description, competition, commitments, controls, and principal risk disclosures."},{"title":"EW quarterly reports","meta":"SEC Forms 10-Q · Primary filings","href":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0001099800&type=10-Q&owner=exclude&count=40","excerpt":"Quarterly reports update financial results, liquidity, cash flow, contingencies, and management discussion between annual reports."},{"title":"EW earnings and current reports","meta":"SEC Forms 8-K · Primary earnings record","href":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0001099800&type=8-K&owner=exclude&count=40","excerpt":"Current reports frequently include earnings releases, presentations, material agreements, leadership changes, and other time-sensitive issuer disclosures."},{"title":"EW proxy statements","meta":"SEC DEF 14A · Governance source","href":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcomp